The logarithm with base cos x requires cos x>0 and cos x≠1. Among those integers, only x=−1 and x=1 satisfy these conditions; x=0 has base 1, while cos 2 and cos 3 are negative. Both ±1 satisfy the arcsine condition.
FINAL_ANSWER: \boxed{-1; 1}

